 R←Test_Compose_03(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;text;subject;addresses
⍝ Long headers are folded: no header line exceeds 78 characters, and unfolding restores the value
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 subject←'A long subject ',(∊{'word',(⍕⍵),' '}¨⍳30),'end'
 parms←∆NewMail subject
 parms.From←'tester@aplteam.test'
 addresses←{'john.doe+',(⍕⍵),'@example.com'}¨⍳10
 parms.CC←⊃{⍺,',',⍵}/addresses
 (rc msg text)←∆Compose parms
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf∧/78≥≢¨∆HeaderLines text
 →T.PassesIf subject≡text ∆Header'Subject'
 →T.PassesIf(⊃{⍺,', ',⍵}/'<',¨addresses,¨'>')≡text ∆Header'CC'

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
